    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Redmond Property are delighted to bring to the market this spacious three-bedroom detached home, ideally situated in the heart of the highly sought-after Applewood Village.\r\n\r\nThis attractive family home enjoys an excellent location, with a wide range of local amenities right on the doorstep. Residents can enjoy convenient access to shops, cafés, parks and recreational facilities, while a number of primary and secondary schools are within walking distance, including Thornleigh Educate Together School, St. Cronan’s National School, Swords Community College, Coláiste Choilm and Fingal Community College. \r\n\r\nFor those who enjoy an active lifestyle, the area is surrounded by excellent sporting and recreational facilities, with The Ward River Valley Park and Broadmeadow Estuary close by. A variety of local sports clubs cater for soccer, Gaelic games, golf and many other activities.\r\n\r\nApplewood Village is a modern residential and commercial development located on the outskirts of Swords, offering a welcoming, family-friendly environment together with excellent transport links. Its location approximately 13km from Dublin City Centre makes it an ideal choice for commuters seeking a well-connected home with all the conveniences of modern living nearby.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall with guest WC and storage press, a bright living room, and a well-proportioned kitchen/dining room with direct access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms, including a generous main bedroom with en-suite shower room, along with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis property offers a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, families or those looking to enjoy the convenience and lifestyle that Applewood Village has to offer. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION - Overall Internal Floor Area: 90 sq. m. \r\n(Please refer to floor plan for room measurements)\r\n\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\nEntrance Hall \r\nLaminate flooring, understairs storage\r\n\r\nGuest w.c. \r\nTiled flooring, w.c and w.h.b.\r\n\r\nLivingroom \r\nLaminate flooring, feature fireplace with gas inset\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining\r\nTiled flooring, wall and floor units, oven, hob, extractor fan, plumbed for dishwasher, gas boiler, door to rear garden\r\n\r\nUtility\r\nTiled flooring, plumbed for washing machine\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nBedroom 1\r\nLaminate flooring, built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nEn-Suite\r\nTiled flooring, shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nLaminate flooring, built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nLaminate flooring, built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nTiled flooring, bath, w.c. and w.h.b. \r\n\r\nHot-press with immersion\r\n\r\nAttic storage\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nSunny west facing rear garden with timber shed, on street parking.\r\n\r\nVIEWING\r\nBy appointment with Redmond Property (Swords)\r\nContact Niamh Jones MIPAV"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Detached house\r\nCommunal on-street parking\r\nSpacious and well balanced living accommodation\r\nDouble glazed uPVC windows\r\nBuilt in wardrobes in all bedrooms\r\nMain bedroom with en-suite shower room\r\nMature, well sought after neighbourhood\r\nExcellent transport links to airport and city centre\r\nClose to schools, shops, restaurants, pub, creche and gym"
      },
